 pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Snooker cue umbrella chin.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/9/94/Snooker_cue_umbrella_chin..png/revision/latest?cb=20240426062058\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Snooker cue umbrella chin.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/9/94/Snooker_cue_umbrella_chin..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240426062058\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/9/94/Snooker_cue_umbrella_chin..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240426062058 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/9/94/Snooker_cue_umbrella_chin..png/revision/latest?cb=20240426062058 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Snooker cue umbrella chin.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Snooker_cue_umbrella_chin..png\" data-image-name=\"Snooker cue umbrella chin..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_17\" title=\"Series 17\">17</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/John_Robins\" title=\"John Robins\">John Robins</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Apropos_of_Apoppo.\" title=\"Apropos of Apoppo.\">Apropos of Apoppo.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_three_ring_man.\" title=\"A three ring man.\">A three ring man.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Snooker cue umbrella chin.</b></i> is the fifth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_17\" title=\"Series 17\">Series 17</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 25 April 2024. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/John_Robins\" title=\"John Robins\">John Robins</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Snooker_cue_umbrella_chin.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> uses the phrase \"Snooker cue umbrella chin\" when referring to <a href=\"/wiki/Nick_Mohammed\" title=\"Nick Mohammed\">Nick Mohammed</a>’s attempt at the <a href=\"/wiki/Be_the_most_impressive_load_bearer\" title=\"Be the most impressive load bearer\">Be the most impressive load bearer</a> task. The title card is of a tie in mid-air, which is a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Take_the_most_dramatic_photo_of_yourself_in_mid-air\" title=\"Take the most dramatic photo of yourself in mid-air\">Take the most dramatic photo of yourself in mid-air</a> task, and the <a href=\"/wiki/Tie_yourself_to_the_bed\" title=\"Tie yourself to the bed\">Tie yourself to the bed</a> task.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Snooker_cue_umbrella_chin.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Snookerkeppisateenvarjoleuka', which translates as 'Snooker cue umbrella chin'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Snooker_cue_umbrella_chin.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Joanne_McNally\" title=\"Joanne McNally\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Joanne McNally</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/John_Robins\" title=\"John Robins\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">John Robins</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Nick_Mohammed\" title=\"Nick Mohammed\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Nick Mohammed</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sophie_Willan\" title=\"Sophie Willan\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sophie Willan</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Steve_Pemberton\" title=\"Steve Pemberton\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Steve Pemberton</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Most_extraordinary_picture\" title=\"Most extraordinary picture\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Most extraordinary picture.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Be_the_most_impressive_load_bearer\" title=\"Be the most impressive load bearer\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Be the most impressive load bearer. You must stand on the doormat, wave with one hand above your head and give a nice big thumbs up with the other whilst bearing the most impressive load. Your load must not be touching anything other than you.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Take_the_most_dramatic_photo_of_yourself_in_mid-air\" title=\"Take the most dramatic photo of yourself in mid-air\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Take the most dramatic photo of yourself in mid-air. You may take five photos.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Tie_yourself_to_the_bed\" title=\"Tie yourself to the bed\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Tie yourself to the bed. You must be horizontal whilst in the lab. If you pull down the terrible tie, you are disqualified.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Park_a_vehicle_in_the_parking_bay\" title=\"Park a vehicle in the parking bay\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Park a vehicle in the parking bay. Your vehicle must be rolled whilst standing on the spot and the worst parker each round is eliminated.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">20\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Snooker_cue_umbrella_chin.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/\"><i>Snooker cue umbrella chin.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141526\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.108 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.144 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 928/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25858/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 182/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.021/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 800559/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   89.587      1 -total\n 53.37%   47.80